"Corrections landed (commit b95977d, user-directed): (1) an action finishes when it has NO NEXT ROUND -- never on an empty round; (2) empty rounds ARE the waits, replacing the Rest effect (deleted from ActionEffect; move/slime_spray pace with [] rounds); (3) effects are DENORMALIZED under ActionRound rows (naming convention kept: ActionRoundAuthor on the wire, ActionRound in storage, action_rounds table) -- one row per round with effects: Vec<ActionEffect>, replacing per-effect ActionStep rows. Round-row existence IS the action lifetime, so the interim Action.round_count field was removed again (rows are the single source of truth). Dangling action state past its rounds logs an error and self-deletes. Full gate green."